  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have successfully built the **Extraction** application, fully matching your design document and styled with premium, high-contrast, responsive visual layouts.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Enhancements & Layout\n\nI transitioned the app into a robust, secure **Full-Stack (Express v4 + Vite)** architecture. All Gemini calls are now routed securely through server-side endpoints (`/api/session/*`) using the modern `@google/genai` TypeScript SDK. The frontend features a **Sophisticated Slate Theme** with micro-animations from `motion/react` and a responsive, dual-column desktop/mobile workspace layout.\n\n---\n\n### Shifted Features & Extraction Suite\n\nThe application boasts the full conversational flow and all **12 interactive extraction modes** outlined in the specification:\n\n1. **Intake & Diagnostic Warmup**: Select preset paths (e.g., career pivots, team friction) or input custom topics. Undergo a quick diagnostic check (*Clarity, Nature, Time, Intent*) to receive a tailored mode recommended dynamically by Gemini.\n2. **Surfaced Thoughts Sidepile**: A live-reactive lateral panel. Every response, card swipe, or slider mapped instantly stacks here as an editable, deletable card tagged by origin mode.\n3. **Interactive Actions Module**:\n   * **Free Stream**: A blank slate supporting active reminders when silent and a **Voice Dictation Simulator** displaying visual waveform loops.\n   * **Quick Fire Mode**: Volley speed questions generated by Gemini on the spot with length warning alerts if typing exceeds seven words.\n   * **Guided Drill**: A conversational therapist-advisor interface holding message history threads and adaptive custom follow-ups.\n   * **Binary Frame / Bracket**: Side-by-side alternative interpretation comparisons collapsing towards solid core belief cards.\n   * **Swipe / React Deck**: Swipe statement card matching (Resonate, Reject, Undecided) dynamically synthesised around the topic.\n   * **Slider / Intensity Map**: Grade thoughts along four axes (*Urgency, Certainty, Emotion, Actionability*) with heat-energy summary notes.\n   * **Card Sort / Cluster**: Category folder creation and dropdown thought assignment mapping headers.\n   * **Timeline Mode**: Plot thoughts on a Past, Present, and Future calendar map.\n   * **Sentence Completion**: Fill incomplete sentence templates (\"The thing I keep not saying is...\").\n   * **Devil\'s Advocate**: Respond directly to discomforting critiques or counter-arguments.\n   * **Letter Writing & Post-Reflection**: Draft letters to itself, situations, or named other parties, then lock down surprising emotional reflections.\n   * **Priority Pile**: Sort points into Eisehower actionable zones (*Act on this*, *Worth watching*, *Leave it*).\n\n---\n\n### Output & Collaboration\n\n* **Cognitive Synthesis Pass**: Gemini evaluates your compiled thoughts list, providing a thoughtful structural overview.\n* **Structured Markdown Outline**: Displays headings, themes, and collapsible bullet lists with a one-click click-to-clipboard markdown exporter.\n* **Refined Task checklist**: Compiles parsed next-steps in a checking layout.\n* **Base64 Snapshots Sharing**: Clicking \"Get Shareable Web Link\" packs your session data into an encoded snapshot URL that lets readers open your full outline instantly without an account.\n* **Persistent Sessions caching**: Save, resume, or delete multiple saved brainstorms dynamically through local caching.\n"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
