  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-[#F8F7F4] text-[#1A1A1A] w-[1024px] h-[768px] p-6 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6 border-b-2 border-black pb-4\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-black flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-white rotate-45\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Extraction</h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-widest\\\">Active Topic</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Potential Career Pivot \342\200\224 Senior Design Lead</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"h-10 w-[1px] bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors\\\">\\n        Export Session\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Bento Grid -->\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-4 flex-grow\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Primary Extraction Interface (Guided Drill) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-8 row-span-4 bg-white border-2 border-black p-8 flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-orange-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-widest text-orange-500\\\">Mode: Guided Drill</span>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-serif italic mb-8 text-zinc-700\\\">\\\"What would have to be true for you to feel ready to leave your current role by September?\\\"</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full p-6 bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 text-lg focus:border-black outline-none transition-all resize-none min-h-[160px]\\\" placeholder=\\\"Type your raw thoughts here... No self-editing allowed.\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">Press Cmd+Enter to push to capture stack</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 border border-black text-[10px] font-bold uppercase hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all\\\">Skip</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 border border-black text-[10px] font-bold uppercase hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all\\\">Different Angle</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">Session Momentum</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Captured Signals Panel -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-6 bg-white border-2 border-black p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Extracted Signals</h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5\\\">14 Items</span>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex-grow space-y-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight\\\">\\\"Fear of losing seniority is actually fear of losing perceived safety net.\\\"</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-orange-400 uppercase font-bold mt-1 block\\\">Load-bearing</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Commute time is stealing creative energy before I even reach the desk.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Desire for more autonomy in product direction over visual execution.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 opacity-50\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Stock options vesting schedule (Nov 15th).</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Need for a \'clean break\' rather than a gradual transition.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">The culture shift at the new firm feels more aligned with long-term ethics.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <button class=\\\"mt-6 w-full py-3 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 text-slate-400 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest hover:border-black hover:text-black transition-all\\\">\\n        Open Cluster View\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Mode Switcher -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-2 bg-[#EFEFEF] border-2 border-black p-6\\\">\\n      <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\\\">Shift Strategy</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Quick Fire</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Rapid 5-word prompts</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-black text-white cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Guided Drill</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-400 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Deep interview loop</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Binary Frame</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Pick between extremes</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Timeline</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Past/Present/Future</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Intensity / Cognitive Map -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-2 bg-black text-white p-6 relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 relative z-10\\\">Cognitive Map</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex items-end gap-2 relative z-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-12 bg-white/20\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-24 bg-white/40\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-32 bg-white/60\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-16 bg-white/40\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-28 bg-orange-500\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-8 bg-white/10\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-2 flex justify-between text-[8px] uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-60 font-mono relative z-10\\\">\\n        <span>Foggy</span>\\n        <span>Clear</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <!-- Background decorative grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 16px 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer / Status Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] uppercase font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <span>Session ID: EXT-992-ALPHA</span>\\n      <span>Duration: 12m 44s</span>\\n      <span>Privacy: Local-First Encryption Active</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span>Language: EN-US</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-[#F8F7F4] text-[#1A1A1A] w-[1024px] h-[768px] p-6 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6 border-b-2 border-black pb-4\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-black flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-white rotate-45\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Extraction</h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-widest\\\">Active Topic</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Potential Career Pivot \342\200\224 Senior Design Lead</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"h-10 w-[1px] bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors\\\">\\n        Export Session\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Bento Grid -->\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-4 flex-grow\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Primary Extraction Interface (Guided Drill) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-8 row-span-4 bg-white border-2 border-black p-8 flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-orange-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-widest text-orange-500\\\">Mode: Guided Drill</span>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-serif italic mb-8 text-zinc-700\\\">\\\"What would have to be true for you to feel ready to leave your current role by September?\\\"</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full p-6 bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 text-lg focus:border-black outline-none transition-all resize-none min-h-[160px]\\\" placeholder=\\\"Type your raw thoughts here... No self-editing allowed.\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">Press Cmd+Enter to push to capture stack</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 border border-black text-[10px] font-bold uppercase hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all\\\">Skip</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 border border-black text-[10px] font-bold uppercase hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all\\\">Different Angle</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">Session Momentum</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-black\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-1 bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Captured Signals Panel -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-6 bg-white border-2 border-black p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Extracted Signals</h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5\\\">14 Items</span>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex-grow space-y-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight\\\">\\\"Fear of losing seniority is actually fear of losing perceived safety net.\\\"</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-orange-400 uppercase font-bold mt-1 block\\\">Load-bearing</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Commute time is stealing creative energy before I even reach the desk.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Desire for more autonomy in product direction over visual execution.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200 opacity-50\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Stock options vesting schedule (Nov 15th).</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">Need for a \'clean break\' rather than a gradual transition.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-tight text-slate-600\\\">The culture shift at the new firm feels more aligned with long-term ethics.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <button class=\\\"mt-6 w-full py-3 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 text-slate-400 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest hover:border-black hover:text-black transition-all\\\">\\n        Open Cluster View\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Mode Switcher -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-2 bg-[#EFEFEF] border-2 border-black p-6\\\">\\n      <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\\\">Shift Strategy</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Quick Fire</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Rapid 5-word prompts</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-black text-white cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Guided Drill</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-400 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Deep interview loop</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Binary Frame</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Pick between extremes</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-white border border-black cursor-pointer hover:invert transition-all\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase\\\">Timeline</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 uppercase leading-tight\\\">Past/Present/Future</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Intensity / Cognitive Map -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-2 bg-black text-white p-6 relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 relative z-10\\\">Cognitive Map</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex items-end gap-2 relative z-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-12 bg-white/20\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-24 bg-white/40\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-32 bg-white/60\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-16 bg-white/40\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-28 bg-orange-500\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1/6 h-8 bg-white/10\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-2 flex justify-between text-[8px] uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-60 font-mono relative z-10\\\">\\n        <span>Foggy</span>\\n        <span>Clear</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <!-- Background decorative grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 16px 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer / Status Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] uppercase font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <span>Session ID: EXT-992-ALPHA</span>\\n      <span>Duration: 12m 44s</span>\\n      <span>Privacy: Local-First Encryption Active</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span>Language: EN-US</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
