r the scrollable component, including its color, size, and layout.\n\n\n**Revising Component Styles**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously updating the styling of key components. The item card now features a bolder look with a black border, a subtle shadow, and a transition effect. I\'ve completely revamped the tool button controls card, adding a significant shadow and thicker border for a more prominent appearance. Finally, I\'ve redesigned the share/print buttons, using a more modern, uppercase font and increased the visual impact.\n\n\n"
