  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Code Completeness**\n\nI\'m thrilled; the linter has given a clean bill of health \342\200\223 no errors, no warnings! It\'s absolutely pristine. I\'m now reviewing the current accomplishments, getting ready to craft a fantastic final design summary.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have reviewed the application\'s core workflows and successfully implemented **all four primary feature opportunities** to elevate the cognitive thought extraction tool. \n\nEach addition is fully functional, complete from client-to-server (no mock boundaries), and retains the cohesive, high-contrast Neo-Brutalist design language of the workspace.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Functional Craftsmanship Overview\n\nHere is the breakdown of the four major improvements now active in your workspace:\n\n#### 1. \360\237\222\254 Bi-Directional Dialogue Toggle (Conversational Coaching)\nInstead of a rigid, one-way interview, you can now toggle **Conversational Mode: ON** inside the **Guided Drill**.\n*   **What was built:** A dynamic switch next to the inputs changing your stance from \"answering\" to \"direct consultation.\"\n*   **How it works:** When active, typing queries (e.g., *\"Why should I categorize this first?\"*) calls a custom `/api/session/drill-clarify` backend endpoint. The model addresses your question directly with elegant, dashed guidance boxes in the timeline, clarifies its coaching methodology, and pivots organically back to the drill with a refined follow-up.\n\n#### 2. \360\237\216\244 Hands-Free Voice Dictation (HTML5Speech Recognition)\nBrain-dumping by typing can be tedious. You can now narrate your thoughts naturally in real time.\n*   **What was built:** Highly responsive, pulsating microphone buttons configured with the native Web Speech API. \n*   **How it works:** Embedded within both the **Guided Drill** panel and the top **Scratch Note** modal-bar. Clicking the icon triggers Chrome/Safari transcription, appending your vocalized ideas directly into the drafts for rapid, frictionless concept extraction.\n\n#### 3. \360\237\216\257 Conceptual Omni-Search & Custom Filters (Surfaced Pile)\nThe list of raw thoughts can grow large. We added dynamic organization to keep your brainstorm perfectly structural.\n*   **What was built:** A comprehensive, real-time query filter and natural language auto-tagging suite in the sidebar.\n*   **How it works:** Beyond searching text inputs, you can filter inputs by dynamic cognitive categories (Actions, deep Insights, potential Fears/Blocks, and Target Goals) instantly processed client-side via heuristic semantic recognition.\n\n#### 4. \360\237\216\233\357\270\217 Post-Synthesis Real-Time Re-Formatter (Dynamic Customization)\nYou can now change how the final output is generated directly from the review page.\n*   **What was built:** A custom yellow-slated **Re-Format Executive Blueprint** control card in the final `ExportPanel` sidebar.\n*   **How it works:** Readjust the guidance tone (Empathetic, Socratic, Standard), change the analysis focus (Task checklists, Milestones only, or Comprehensive summaries), and toggle the Cognitive Bias Audit on or off. Clicking **Regenerate Outline** instantly redraws the synthesized document.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 632419554
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
