    thinking: "**Celebrating Code Success**\n\nI\'m thrilled! The linter gave us a clean bill of health. I\'ve successfully incorporated retro neo-brutalist bento colors for PRESETS card backgrounds and hover effects. I\'ve also added beautiful multi-colored accent step highlight badges, with red (#FF6B6B) for step 01, and blue (#4DABF7) for step 02.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed a suite of visual enhancements to infuse the application with **vibrant, high-contrast flat layout colors**, while strictly preserving the professional, premium **Neo-Brutalist Bento grid** identity:\n\n### \360\237\214\210 Design & Style Upgrades\n\n#### 1. Colorful Quick-Start Presets Grid (Intake Dashboard)\n- **Aesthetic Tints**: Replaced plain white panels with custom retro pastel background and hover states:\n  - \360\237\215\221 **Peach/Orange** for Career Decisions\n  - \360\237\214\214 **Clear Ice-Blue** for Team Retrospectives\n  - \360\237\214\277 **Sage Leaf Green** for Side Projects\n  - \360\237\214\274 **Buttercream Yellow** for Stack-Dumping Overwhelm\n  - \360\237\214\212 **Pool Turquoise** for Delicate Writing\n  - \360\237\215\207 **Lavender-Grape** for Retrospectives\n  - \360\237\214\270 **Cherry Pink** for Major Purchases\n\n#### 2. Vibrant Progress Flags\n- **Intake Flow Badges**: Styled Step `01`, `02`, and `03` numbers into beautiful thick-bordered colorful blocks using energetic vermilion red, bright sky-blue, and rich emerald green.\n- **Intention Selection**: Enabled a warm golden-sand cream highlight (`#FFF3BF`) on selection.\n\n#### 3. Responsive Advanced Synthesis Tones (Step 03)\n- Substituted heavy black selected blocks with accessible, low-friction flat colors:\n  - \360\237\215\212 **Warm Apricot** for Prompting Tones\n  - \360\237\214\220 **Clean Periwinkle** for Structured Output Filters\n  - \360\237\215\203 **Soft Mint Green** for Intellectual Bias Audits\n\n#### 4. High-Fidelity Active Filter Tags (Workspace Sidebar)\n- Transformed monochrome sidebar categories into color-matched interactive buttons with drop-shadow shifts:\n  - \342\232\241 **Vivid Red** for Actions\n  - \360\237\222\241 **Bright Blue** for Insights\n  - \342\232\240\357\270\217 **Bright Yellow** for Fears\n  - \360\237\216\257 **Bright Green** for Goals\n\n#### 5. Bold Playful Controls (Swipe Statement Mode)\n- Converted cards and buttons into a colorful, tactile playground:\n  - **The Deck Card**: Reshaped into a bold banana-yellow card featuring high-contrast thick borders (`border-3 border-black`) and a custom deep shadow.\n  - **Tactile Thumbs Controllers**: Finished with bouncier, self-expressive action states: vermilion-red for reject, sky-blue for maybe, and cheerful emerald-lime for resonance!"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 145834561
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
